{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2096","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Wonderful City"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are the proud leader of a city in Ancient Berland. There are $$$n^2$$$ buildings arranged in a grid of $$$n$$$ rows and $$$n$$$ columns. The height of the building in row $$$i$$$ and column $$$j$$$ is $$$h_{i, j}$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The city is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beautiful"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if no two adjacent by side buildings have the same height. In other words, it must satisfy the following:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" There "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"does not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" exist a position $$$(i, j)$$$ ($$$1 \\leq i \\leq n$$$, $$$1 \\leq j \\leq n - 1$$$) such that $$$h_{i, j} = h_{i, j + 1}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" There "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"does not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" exist a position $$$(i, j)$$$ ($$$1 \\leq i \\leq n - 1$$$, $$$1 \\leq j \\leq n$$$) such that $$$h_{i, j} = h_{i + 1, j}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ workers at company A, and $$$n$$$ workers at company B. Each worker can be hired "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at most once"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It costs $$$a_i$$$ coins to hire worker $$$i$$$ at company A. After hiring, worker $$$i$$$ will:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Increase the heights of all buildings in row $$$i$$$ by $$$1$$$. In other words, increase $$$h_{i, 1}, h_{i, 2}, \\ldots, h_{i, n}$$$ by $$$1$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It costs $$$b_j$$$ coins to hire worker $$$j$$$ at company B. After hiring, worker $$$j$$$ will:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Increase the heights of all buildings in column $$$j$$$ by $$$1$$$. In other words, increase $$$h_{1, j}, h_{2, j}, \\ldots, h_{n, j}$$$ by $$$1$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the minimum number of coins needed to make the city beautiful, or report that it is impossible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 100$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 1000$$$) — the size of the grid."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the next $$$n$$$ lines of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$h_{i, 1}, h_{i, 2}, \\ldots, h_{i, n}$$$ ($$$1 \\le h_{i, j} \\le 10^9$$$) — the heights of the buildings in row $$$i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$) — the costs of hiring the workers at company A."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$b_1, b_2, \\ldots, b_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le b_j \\le 10^9$$$) — the costs of hiring the workers at company B."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$1000$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the minimum number of coins needed, or $$$-1$$$ if it is impossible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n2\n1 2\n2 1\n100 100\n100 100\n4\n1 2 1 2\n3 2 1 2\n1 2 1 1\n1 3 1 2\n1 2 3 4\n5 6 7 8\n3\n1 2 2\n2 2 1\n2 1 1\n100 100 100\n100 100 100\n6\n8 7 2 8 4 8\n7 7 9 7 1 1\n8 3 1 1 8 5\n6 8 3 1 1 4\n1 4 5 1 9 6\n7 1 1 6 8 2\n11 23 20 79 30 15\n15 83 73 57 34 63\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n14\n-1\n183\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first test case, we can see that the city is already beautiful. Thus, the answer is $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second test ca